00:01:57.470 --> 00:02:01.010
A Fairy's Power

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:09.480
Well, Kamui did say it would hit hard.

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:13.570
I mean, I knew there'd be
a hurdle before the goblin assault,

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:17.160
but for it to be so relentless...

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:22.790
Buck up! I made a nice discovery
while you were training.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:25.830
{=2}Consultation Office

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:25.920
You mean...

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:29.290
{=3}Consultation Office

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:28.840
Training attracts rough
and tumble characters.

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:31.000
Problems are bound to erupt.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.010
To heal Guards' ailing hearts.

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:36.590
That is the Counseling Office's purpose!

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:37.590
I think.

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.510
You think? You don't know?

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:42.300
Consultation Office

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:42.470
I mean, this event is new to me, too!

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:45.310
But I'm sure this place
is just what you need!

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.860
I-I don't think it's necessary.

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:50.480
You're being extorted, Hiro!

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:53.860
Don't let it slide because it's a game!

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:58.410
Okay. Tell me what's troubling you.

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:04.750
Um, well, I just became a Guard,
but fitting in has been a challenge...

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.540
In what way?

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:11.920
The instructor dismisses me,
and my peers are making fun of me...

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:14.470
Hiro, tell him about the money, too!

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:16.340
A-And um...

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:21.810
...well, I-I'm being extorted for money.

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:28.060
Please, tell me everything.

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:29.140
Consultation Office

00:03:28.060 --> 00:03:29.440
I see.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:31.650
I see the issue.

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:34.230
Y-You do? So then--

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:37.820
Listen, aren't you to blame here, too?

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:38.990
What?!

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.950
From what you've told me,

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:45.580
the root cause is that you joined
the Guard with no skill to speak of.

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.790
But Tesla invited me to join.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:49.880
Couldn't you have simply declined?

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:52.540
Well, I suppose so...

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:55.510
Anyway, I recommend quitting immediately.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:58.180
You have plenty of
other options ahead of you.

00:03:58.180 --> 00:03:59.640
Okay, the next person can come in.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:00.640
H-Hold on a--

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:03.800
Consultation Office

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:03.720
<i>Next person</i>.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.350
That was useless!

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:09.390
Why even have this place?

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:14.070
In reality, most counseling offices are
like this and rarely solve anything.

00:04:14.070 --> 00:04:17.740
Then <i>why </i>did you make me go?

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:20.570
Well, don't you feel
at least a little better?

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:23.490
It may well help down the line.

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:25.200
Really?

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.120
I somehow doubt that.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:29.080
Oh, Hiro.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:31.210
Cathy.

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:33.960
Hiro, do you feel unwell?

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:44.180
Consultation Office

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:36.090
No, I feel fine.

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:37.800
Oh, good.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:41.300
This consultation office
is for illnesses and injuries.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.550
It's not helpful for normal problems.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:45.220
Huh?

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:49.100
What did I expect?

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:53.690
If something's troubling you,
there are some other options.

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:55.770
This for instance...

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:57.280
What's that?

00:04:57.280 --> 00:05:00.570
When things are tough, I pray.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.910
Then good things happen.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.320
Oh...

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:09.080
Anyway, it's best not to let things
get to you. Just go at your own pace.

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:11.920
Yeah. Thanks.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:19.090
We're actually praying?

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:23.800
Cathy seems religious,
but I don't really have faith.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:27.010
You dummy. That was totally a quest flag.

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:29.520
It screams praying event!

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:31.770
That's a standard game
advancement technique.

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:34.190
T-True...

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:37.150
I see.

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:39.650
I see the issue.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:42.400
Y-You do? So then--

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:46.530
I see a sort of dark cloud around you.

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:49.540
I shall perform a cleansing ritual.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:54.330
What do you think the cleansing ritual is?

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:58.300
Hmm, maybe something like a baptism?

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:01.130
Oh, a baptism.

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:02.670
I've heard of--

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:03.550
Huh?

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:04.970
What?

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:12.680
Th-This is a baptism?!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:15.190
Seems more like a penalty game!

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:19.900
By being doused in holy water,
your body has been cleansed.

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:23.650
From now on, all is sure to go well.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:28.580
Th-Thank you very m--<i>achoo</i>!

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:31.870
So cold.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:33.960
Isn't that great, Hiro?

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:37.000
You think something's going to change now?

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.590
I'm certain there will be
a positive development!

00:06:39.590 --> 00:06:41.300
I can't wait for tomorrow!

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:43.920
I-I hope s--<i>achoo</i>!

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:45.300
Oh, ick!

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.430
Cover your mouth!

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:48.260
S-Sorry!

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.760
Day 4

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.760
Day 4

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:58.610
Nothing's changed at all! Oh, come on!

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:04.530
That's odd. Should we have
made a big monetary offering?

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:07.070
You really are a weakling.

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:09.120
Keep doing practice swings alone.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:11.160
Forever.

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:15.290
Dammit!

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:17.370
Totally pathetic.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:20.250
Weakness is truly a sin.

00:07:20.250 --> 00:07:21.840
So pay up.

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:23.170
It's collection time.

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:24.880
Don't you remember?

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:27.340
I-I have no money.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.760
That's not the deal.

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:31.510
We have no choice.

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.770
There have to be consequences.

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:36.350
Today you'll face me.

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:39.730
Hiro, this twerp looks weak! Get him!

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:44.570
T-True. Granada is
one thing, but this guy...

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:47.950
Oh, this idiot's serious, Palù.

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:52.660
C-Come at me!

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:53.990
In that case,

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:56.290
here I come!

00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:58.620
H-He's fast!

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:04.760
Hey now, what's wrong?

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:11.260
I-I surrender! You win!

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:14.810
We're not done yet!

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:18.060
Stop! Please stop!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.560
H-Hey!

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:20.600
That's too far!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.310
Shouldn't we stop this?

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:24.650
Over here, sir! Hurry!

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:27.360
Hey, Palù.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:30.490
What happened? What's going on?

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:33.080
Why, we're just training, sir.

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:38.040
Yeah. We were helping
Hiro with his training.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.090
Ah. Okay then.

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:47.130
But, sir! It's clear that...

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:50.050
Okay, okay. Everyone resume training!

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:53.720
Not a damned thing's changed!

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:57.850
Despite the counseling and the baptism.

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:00.480
Hiro.

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:05.400
In the real world you solve your own
problems! You shouldn't rely on others!

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:08.440
<i>You </i>told me to do those things!

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:11.110
Why're you screaming at nobody?

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:14.280
Did ya finally lose it?

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:15.910
Cathy...

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:19.710
Hey, what's the deal with you two, anyway?

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:22.040
W-We're friends.

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:24.420
Oh, friends, eh?

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:30.260
Cathy, if you're friends, then you'll
get the same treatment as Hiro.

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:32.550
You want that?

00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:38.430
Tell me, Cathy. Are you
really friends with Hiro?

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.680
I-I...

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:45.610
Come on, Cathy. Speak up.

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:49.190
I-I...

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:51.240
I...

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:56.490
Hiro and I... aren't friends.

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:01.910
There you go, Cathy!

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:06.340
Looks like Hiro just
assumed they were friends!

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:16.550
Hiro, are you okay?

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:18.220
Of course not!

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:20.810
And I heard you laughing by the way!

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:25.310
Not only were you bullied,
but then you were betrayed by a friend.

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:28.020
That must sting.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:30.530
Cathy's not to blame.

00:10:30.530 --> 00:10:33.110
She did what anyone would've...

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:36.370
Well, anyway, let's shake it off.

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:37.570
This is a game.

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:40.290
You're not getting bullied in real life.

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:43.830
Besides, there's only one day left.

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:49.210
There's still another whole day of this?
I'm already despondent.

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.420
Hiro...

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:54.760
I don't want to overstep my role, but...

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:56.010
Okay.

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:58.720
I'll do something about this.

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:01.060
What can even be done?

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:02.470
Take heart.

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:06.020
I'll show you the holy power of a fairy.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:09.390
Day 5

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:09.390
Day 5

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:13.740
Argh! Dammit!

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:16.360
Where are my boots, dammit?

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:20.080
G-Granada, maybe you just
forgot where you left them.

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:22.750
I definitely took them off here!

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:25.500
But now they're gone!

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:27.460
Maybe so, but...

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:29.790
we've searched a lot.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:35.260
Th-There's a spare pair. For now just wear
those and we'll look again later. Okay?

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:37.300
Dammit.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:40.390
L-Look! Aren't those Granada's boots?

00:11:40.390 --> 00:11:41.720
What?!

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:44.640
Ew, gross.

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:46.730
That's awful.

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:49.480
Dammit! What the hell?

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:57.200
Aren't these the boots your grandma made
for you when you became a mercenary?

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:59.160
Who was it?

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:02.410
Who the hell did this?

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:12.340
The sewage incident with
Granada's boots was merely a prelude.

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:15.550
It's gone! My sword is gone!

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:17.760
I know I left it here!

00:12:17.760 --> 00:12:20.590
Who the hell took it?

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:21.430
Whoa.

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:22.220
Him again?

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:24.060
He's pissed.

00:12:24.060 --> 00:12:27.180
Hey! Who just laughed?

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:31.560
Listen, we'll all look for it.

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:35.360
It's a greatsword with
a dragon emblem on the hilt, right?

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:36.940
Guess we have to.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:38.820
Let's check outside.

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:40.860
What about that ditch?

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:47.000
Like with the boots, we searched
high and low for the sword.

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:51.080
But try as we might, we couldn't find it.

00:12:53.090 --> 00:12:56.090
Enough. Screw it.

00:12:56.090 --> 00:12:59.630
We'll try again tomorrow.
I'm sure it'll turn up.

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.760
Leave me alone!

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:08.930
Jeez. At least say thank you.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:15.150
What the <i>hell </i>is this?!

00:13:15.150 --> 00:13:16.940
What's wrong?

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:26.120
Hey, is that...?

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:31.170
Oh, shit! His greatsword
is crammed in the crapper!

00:13:31.170 --> 00:13:33.130
Wh-Why?

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:35.250
Why?

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:46.010
Hiro!

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:47.720
It was you, right?

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:49.560
N-No, it wasn't!

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:51.140
Also, wash your hands!

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:55.770
It <i>had </i>to be! You took my
boots and sword to spite me!

00:13:55.770 --> 00:14:00.440
Knock it off! You have no proof,
and Hiro didn't have time to do it.

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:02.320
What?! But he--

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:06.780
Stop taking it out on him.
Hiro helped look for your sword.

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:11.210
Oh my!

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:15.290
What's wrong?

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:17.840
What's wrong, Maria?

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:21.420
The panties I left in
the locker room are gone!

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:24.890
These panties are
pure white like my heart!

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:29.100
And with flowers embroidered on the back!

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:30.060
What?

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:31.810
What's going on?

00:14:31.810 --> 00:14:33.730
Do we have a thief?

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:36.110
H-Hey, look!

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:40.480
m 565 440 l 561 450 536 515 528 537 526 541 518 539 505 536 496 533 482 529 469 525 456 520 446 516 431 509 420 504 410 499 400 494 385 486 372 480 361 473 352 468 340 459 330 452 320 445 307 435 298 427 287 418 277 408 268 399 261 391 256 384 253 381 272 325 279 308 288 289 292 280 306 292 318 301 329 309 340 317 352 326 362 333 376 342 387 350 399 357 409 363 418 369 429 375 440 381 450 386 464 394 477 400 487 405 501 413 518 421 533 428 547 433

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:40.480
Granada

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:44.610
This... is Granada's bag...

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:46.200
What?

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:48.030
Oh my!

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:50.660
These are my panties!

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:52.330
Oh my!

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:55.580
He stole my panties!

00:14:55.580 --> 00:15:01.130
He must've intended to do
dirty, nasty things with them!

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:03.050
Don't flatter yourself, hag!

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:07.090
Like I'd want the panties
of an ugly, old biddy like you!

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:10.350
How can you be so <i>cruel</i>?

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:13.890
With all the lonely nights
after my husband died,

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:15.390
I just wanted to feel cute!

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:18.110
Is this what I get for
embroidering flowers on them?

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:20.270
Is that it?

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:23.900
Granada, enough is enough!

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.360
What's wrong with you?

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:27.240
But this hag--

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:31.910
Hey! How dare you speak
about our nurse like that?!

00:15:31.910 --> 00:15:35.870
Yeah, you damned panty thief!

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:38.210
I-I said it wasn't me!

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:41.500
Then how did they get into your bag?

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:42.090
Yeah!

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:42.960
Pervert!

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:45.300
I don't know! I don't know!

00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:48.140
Your skills don't give you free rein!

00:15:48.140 --> 00:15:50.260
Being a Guard is about teamwork.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:53.470
Nobody needs guys like you.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:55.180
Don't act like hot stuff.

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:58.230
Not with the face of a goblin.

00:15:58.230 --> 00:15:59.060
I see it!

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:01.150
He looks like a goblin.

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:06.740
Let's go, Palù.

00:16:06.740 --> 00:16:12.790
D-Don't talk to me! Keep your bootless,
shitty-sworded goblin face away from me!

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:18.670
Let's go, guys. If we stick around,
the goblin will rub off on us.

00:16:18.670 --> 00:16:20.670
H-Hey...

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:38.980
I just received word from Granada.
He's quitting the Guard.

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:41.400
He says it's for personal reasons.

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:43.980
I can't believe this!

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:48.320
I swear, the recruits
lately have no mettle!

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:52.200
Oh, practice on your own now. No slacking!

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:55.450
Oh, Captain Tesla! You honor us!

00:16:55.450 --> 00:17:00.120
I'm sorry to interrupt your training.
I found <i>this </i>on my desk.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:03.210
Uh... and that is...?

00:17:03.210 --> 00:17:09.170
It says the one who stole Granada's boots
and drove him to quit was <i>you</i>, Amos.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.880
What?

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:13.010
What?!

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:17.140
E-Excuse me? Wh-Why would I do that?

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:19.730
According to the letter,

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:26.480
a few days ago, Granada earned
your ire by besting you in training.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:28.900
Isn't that right, Palù?

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:31.490
You sent me this letter.

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:33.570
"Palù"

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:36.240
P-P-P-Palù! You fink!

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:39.960
I-I've never seen this letter!
It must be a prank!

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:41.120
Stop lying!

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:43.210
And that goes for
what's in the letter, too!

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:46.960
Amos, I know not whether this is true.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:50.010
But I <i>do </i>know you to have sub-par conduct.

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:52.260
Just look how late
you are to arrive today.

00:17:52.260 --> 00:17:56.220
A-About that, uh, you see...

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.140
I must ask you all.

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:02.350
Is Amos fit to be Training Instructor?

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:05.980
Th-This is rather sudden...

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:08.190
Why you little...

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.320
He is decidedly not, sir.

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:16.370
Cathy...

00:18:16.370 --> 00:18:19.700
Granada and Palù were bullying Hiro!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:22.660
Amos saw it and did nothing!

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:28.840
Wh-What?! The way I treated Hiro
was the same way the rest of you did!

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:32.260
Yes, it wasn't just Instructor Amos.

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:37.550
Everyone else--including me--
were terrible to Hiro!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:39.060
She's right.

00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:40.720
All of us...

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:43.060
We treated him coldly.

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:47.270
Th-That's right! Reflect on your
actions and apologize to Hiro!

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:51.320
Can it! You were the worst of all!

00:18:51.320 --> 00:18:53.610
H-How dare you speak
to a superior that way?!

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:56.410
You never even bothered to teach anyone.

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:59.200
I bet you also took Granada's sword!

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.290
Yeah!

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:01.910
Confess already!

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:03.830
It was you!

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:06.540
Wh-Why-Why you...

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.540
Crap instructor!

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:07.540
You suck!

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:10.300
You act high and mighty!

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:15.840
C-Captain Tesla!
They're all lying to frame me!

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:19.220
With regard to Grenada,
the truth is unclear.

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:20.760
Nor is there any hope for proof.

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:23.060
S-So then...

00:19:23.060 --> 00:19:27.730
However, out of all these soldiers,
not a single one defended you.

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:32.650
It would appear that
you are unfit to lead.

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:35.860
For the time being,
you are relieved of this position.

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:41.830
All of you continue your training
until a new instructor arrives.

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:44.160
Th-This can't be!

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.170
Captain Tesla! Wait!

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:48.000
Sir, please wait!

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:51.710
Captain Tesla!

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:54.170
Hiro, I'm sorry.

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:57.180
I'm truly sorry.

00:19:57.180 --> 00:19:59.930
I-It's fine. Don't be.

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:01.510
We're sorry, too.

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:02.600
Forgive us.

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:04.310
Let's train hard together!

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:06.020
Yeah.

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:08.150
But what about...?

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:18.280
Mission complete!

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:22.030
Behold a fairy's holy power!

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:25.370
And of course it was you, Reona.

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:28.420
Huh? Are you crying tears of joy?

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:29.920
You went way too far!

00:20:29.920 --> 00:20:31.170
"Holy" my ass!

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:33.050
That was wicked and sinister!

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:36.970
What are you saying, Hiro? When you're
wronged, you have to strike back!

00:20:36.970 --> 00:20:39.430
It was too far by any measure!

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:43.430
I've never seen a grown man
bawl his eyes out like that!

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:45.180
Oh, right...

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:47.390
We still need to give
Palù what he deserves!

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:49.100
Don't, I'm begging you!

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:52.480
You've already done more than enough!

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:55.530
Hiro, a new title!

00:20:55.530 --> 00:21:01.620
"Diabolic, Spiteful Best Friend Killer:
Amicide Wicked as the Devil"?!

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:04.280
Why is this being pinned on <i>me</i>?

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:07.540
In the end, I'm just your
support character.

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:11.040
This title says "wicked" and "devil"!

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:14.460
It makes "Best Best
Friend Killer" look tame!

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:16.630
Hey, it's no big deal really.

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:20.470
Tomorrow's the goblin assault.
Are you prepared?

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:22.510
Not in the slightest!

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:24.220
I haven't gotten any stronger!

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:27.890
Tomorrow my console is toast for sure!

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:29.060
So...

00:21:29.060 --> 00:21:30.480
...are you quitting?

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:35.230
I'll get as far as I can.

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:37.650
I've already made it this far, anyway.

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:44.120
I can't tell if that's strength
or weakness talking.

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:46.870
What does <i>that </i>mean?

00:21:46.870 --> 00:21:49.910
But your resolve is clear.

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:52.830
Thanks for continuing to play KQ.

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:55.630
And in recognition of your resolve,

00:21:55.630 --> 00:21:58.590
I'll be honest with you.

00:21:58.590 --> 00:22:00.760
Reona?

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:07.930
Honest about why I've gone to such lengths
to find someone who can clear the game.

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:49.950
A New Ally

00:23:45.820 --> 00:23:48.950
Episode 10: A New Ally.
